Esme,<br />
<br />
As of today you're Romy Galloway's A&R. She's our most important artist, so=
 take your time to get up to speed. Nate's handoff notes are attached.<br /=
>
<br />
Two dates to know now. Night Ferry delivers February 26, and our decision o=
n the option for her fourth album is due to her team by January 15. I want =
your recommendation by mid-December.<br />
<br />
Diane
